{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42159","headline":"和元帅书记萧郎中观习水师 · 徐铉","name":"和元帅书记萧郎中观习水师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元帅楼船出治兵，落星山外火旗明。\n千帆日助江陵势，万里风驰下濑声。\n杀气晓严波上鷁，凯歌遥骇海边鲸。\n仲宣一作从军咏，回顾儒衣自不平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42159.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42159","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}